# Smartup24 — Loyiha Bilim Bazasi

## Proyekt haqida
- Playwright + Python test avtomatizatsiyasi (Smartup24 ERP tizimi)
- Framework: pytest + playwright-python + allure
- Staging URL: https://app3.greenwhite.uz/x24/a2/auth/login
- Default login: admin@autotest / greenwhite

## Katalog tuzilmasi
```
conftest.py          — pytest fixtures (browser, page, session_page, code, save_data, load_data)
utils/base_page.py   — BasePage class (barcha page object class shu classdan meros oladi)
flows/               — reusable flow funksiyalari
  flow_authorization.py  — authorization(), logout()
  flow_navbar.py         — flow_navigate(page, tab, name), flow_search(), flow_menu()
tests/               — asosiy test fayllari (Page Object pattern bilan)
test_*.py (root)     — qo'shimcha/runner testlar
```

## conftest.py — Fixtures

| Fixture | Scope | Tavsif |
|---------|-------|--------|
| `browser` | function | Har test uchun yangi Chromium browser (headless=False, --start-maximized) |
| `page` | function | Har test uchun yangi page + trace yozadi + logout() oxirida |
| `session_browser` | session | Butun sessiya uchun bitta browser (smoke runner) |
| `session_context` | session | Session uchun bitta context + trace |
| `session_page` | session | Session uchun bitta page — holat testlar orasida saqlanadi |
| `code` | session | random 4-xonali raqam (str), har sessiyada bir marta |
| `save_data` | session | `save_data(key, value, file_name)` → test-results/data/{file_name}.json |
| `load_data` | session | `load_data(key, file_name)` → json fayldan o'qish |

Timeout konstantalari (conftest.py):
- `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT = 10_000` ms — click, fill, expect
- `NAVIGATION_TIMEOUT = 60_000` ms — page.goto, wait_for_load_state

## BasePage (utils/base_page.py) — Asosiy metodlar

### Input bilan ishlash
```python
# Oddiy text input/textarea
self.input(label="Код", value="123")
self.input(ng_model="d.name", value="test")
self.input(placeholder="Поиск", value="abc")
self.input(locator="input.cls", value="x")
self.input(label="Kod", return_value=True)   # qiymatni qaytaradi
self.input(label="Kod", expect_value="123")  # faqat tekshiradi

# Single-select b-input (dropdown bilan)
self.b_input_by_label("Статус", "Активный")
self.b_input_by_label("Склад", "Центральный склад", server_search=True)
self.b_input_by_label("Тип", return_value=True)

# Multi-select b-input ("N Выбранных")
self.multiselect("Роли", "Менеджер", "Администратор")
self.multiselect("Роли", "Менеджер", name="roles")  # name bilan

# Oddiy select dropdown (ng-model asosida)
self.select_option("d.type", "Тип А")
self.select_b_input("d.status", "Активный")
```

### Checkbox / Switch
```python
self.checkbox(label="НДС", checked=True)           # label orqali, holatga keltiradi
self.checkbox(ng_model="d.vat_enabled", checked=False)
self.checkbox(check_all=True)                      # grid "hammasini tanlash"
self.checkbox(first_visible=True)                  # birinchi ko'rinadigan grid checkbox
self.checkbox(label="НДС", expect_checked=True)    # faqat tekshiradi
self.checkbox(label="НДС", return_value=True)      # bool qaytaradi
```

### Grid bilan ishlash
```python
self.grid_row("Товар А")                           # qatorni topib ko'rinishini tekshiradi
self.grid_row("Товар А", "Активный", "100")        # qatorni topib, matnlarni tekshiradi
self.click_grid_row("Товар А")                     # qatorni topib bosadi
row = self.grid_row("Товар А")
row.get_by_role("button", name="Редактировать").click()

# Grid controller (list forma)
self.grid_controller(search="Товар")
self.grid_controller(reload=True)
self.grid_controller(expand=True)
self.grid_controller(open_filter=True)
self.grid_controller(open_setting=True)
```

### Saqlash va navigate
```python
# "Сохранить" tugmasini bosib, yangi heading ochilishini kutadi
self.save_and_expect_heading("Список товаров")
self.save_and_expect_heading("Список", button_name="Применить", exact_button=False)
self.save_and_expect_heading("Список", confirm_text="Подтвердить")  # confirm modal bilan
```

### Loader / Alert
```python
self.wait_for_loader()                   # .block-ui-overlay yo'qolishini kutadi
self.visible_error_text()                # UI da xato matni (biruniAlert va h.k.)
self.close_extended_alert()              # #biruniAlertExtended ni yopadi
self.confirm_biruni("Удалить?")          # confirm modal ni "да" bilan yopadi
self.confirm_biruni(button_name="нет")
```

### Sana tanlash
```python
self.select_date("d.date", option="today")
self.select_date("d.date", option="first")   # oy boshi
self.select_date("d.date", option="last")    # oy oxiri
self.select_date("d.date", option="custom", day=15)
self.select_date("d.date", option="today", add_days=7)
```

### Heading va error
```python
self.current_heading_text()   # sahifadagi barcha heading matnlari ("|" bilan ulangan)
self.visible_error_text()     # biruniAlert, toast, .alert-danger va h.k.
```

## Flows

### Authorization
```python
from flows.flow_authorization import authorization, logout

authorization(page)                                        # default: admin@autotest
authorization(page, email="user@test", password="pass")
logout(page)                                               # chiqish (conftest fixture da avtomatik chaqiriladi)
```

### Navbar navigatsiya
```python
from flows.flow_navbar import flow_navigate, flow_search, flow_menu

flow_navigate(page, tab="Модератор", name="Товары")     # tab → menuitem
flow_navigate(page, tab="Продажи", name="Заказы")
flow_search(page, name="Товар")                          # global qidiruv
flow_menu(page)                                          # settings menu
```

## Muhim Smartup24 selectorlari

| Element | Selector |
|---------|----------|
| Asosiy widget konteyner | `app-form-stack-widget` |
| Grid | `b-grid` |
| Grid qatori | `b-grid .tbl-row` |
| Dropdown input | `b-input` |
| Loader overlay | `.block-ui-overlay` |
| Alert (kengaytirilgan) | `#biruniAlertExtended` |
| Alert (oddiy) | `#biruniAlert` |
| Confirm modal | `#biruniConfirm` |
| CDK overlay backdrop | `.cdk-overlay-backdrop` |

## Test yozish qoidalari

1. **Page Object pattern**: har bir sahifa uchun `BasePage` dan meros oluvchi class yoz.
2. **Fixture ishlatish**: `page` (har test uchun yangi) yoki `session_page` (holat saqlanadigan).
3. **Timeout**: `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT` va `NAVIGATION_TIMEOUT` constantalaridan foydalanish kerak; magic number yozma.
4. **Allure**: `@allure.story`, `@allure.title`, `@allure.step` dekoratorlari bilan.
5. **Overlay muammo**: CDK overlay backdrop flaky bo'lishi mumkin — `wait_for_loader()` dan keyin click; `expect(locator).to_be_visible()` before click.
6. **save_data/load_data**: testlar orasida ma'lumot uzatish uchun JSON fixture ishlatiladi.
7. **code fixture**: noyob nom yaratish uchun `code` fixture ga `str(code)` qo'shiladi.

## Loyiha yo'llari (key paths)

- Allure natijalar: `test-results/allure-results/`
- Trace fayllar: `test-results/traces/`
- Test data: `test-results/data/`
- Allure kategoriyalar: `allure/categories.json`
